			"notes": "## What's new\n\n- **HUD editor** — press \\H\\ to open, drag elements anywhere on screen, right-click to toggle visibility, enable/disable the entire HUD with one button\n- **Auto gamemode detection** — switches to the correct gamemode automatically when a ranked match starts (reads chat message and scoreboard)\n- **Nametag editor** — customise how player nametags are displayed\n- Removed HUD button from leaderboard screen (use \\H\\ key instead)\n\n## Requirements\n- Minecraft 1.21.11\n- Fabric Loader 0.18.2+\n- Fabric API 0.139.5+1.21.11"
