			"notes": "Initial release.\n\n## Features\n- ELO and rank icons in the tab list\n- Rank display above player name tags\n- Leaderboards for all 9 gamemodes\n- Full player stats with ELO history and match history\n- Customizable HUD (gamemode, your ELO, opponent ELO)\n- Skin previews and cached avatars\n\n## Keybinds\n- \\G\\ — Open leaderboard\n- \\Y\\ — Cycle gamemode\n- \\O\\ — Toggle name tags\n- \\H\\ — Open HUD editor\n\n## Requirements\n- Minecraft 1.21.11\n- Fabric Loader 0.18.2+\n- Fabric API 0.139.5+1.21.11"
